 class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Requested (target) ratio</span><span class=\"v\">1.50x</span></div><h2>Baseline comparison (pooled ladder residuals)</h2><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Model MAE</span><span class=\"v\">0.263</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">naive_mean MAE</span><span class=\"v\">0.699</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">naive_nn MAE</span><span class=\"v\">0.729</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">beats both baselines</span><span class=\"v\">yes</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">pooled residuals (n)</span><span class=\"v\">70</span></div><h2>Physics assumptions</h2><div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">a (default)</span><span class=\"v\">0.026</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">alpha (default)</span><span class=\"v\">0.4</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">aspect_ratio_h_over_t (default)</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">beta (default)</span><span class=\"v\">0.5</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">impeller_to_tank_diameter_ratio (default)</span><span class=\"v\">0.3333</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">liquid_density_kg_per_m3 (default)</span><span class=\"v\">1000</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">power_number (default)</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">reference_scale_L (default)</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div></div><h2>Provenance</h2><div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">engine version</span><span class=\"v\">0.1.0</span></div><div class=\"kv kv-hash\"><span class=\"k\">kalos git SHA</span><span class=\"v\">golden-build</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">candidate</span><span class=\"v\">v0</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">alpha</span><span class=\"v\">0.1</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">seed</span><span class=\"v\">0</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"